cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below and cite the accompanying preprint."
type: software
title: "Morpheus.AI: benchmark and tools for LLM agents that build Morpheus multicellular models"
abstract: >-
  Benchmark runner, Morpheus agent skill, Model Context Protocol (MCP) server, biological scoring
  criteria and analysis scripts used to test whether LLM-based coding agents can rebuild published
  multicellular models in the Morpheus simulator. The release reproduces the subject-facing setup
  of benchmark version 3 (git tag benchmark-v3) that produced the runs reported in the
  accompanying preprint.
